                EHM/MRO  CHANGE HISTORY
                =======================

REL   DATE         BY      DESCRIPTION
---   ----------   -----   ---------------------------------------------

1.0   14-MAR-1988  R.T.H.  FIRST ISSUE.  FLEET MASTER LOAD AND THE
                           FLEET STATUS SUMMARY ONLY.  SIXTY ENGINES.

1.1   06-JUN-1988  A.M.S.  PRINTED OUTPUT SPLIT OUT INTO RPTGEN.C AND
                           PAGED FOR THE LINE PRINTER.

1.3   19-JAN-1989  R.T.H.  RUN LOG ADDED.  MESSAGE NUMBERING SCHEME
                           EHM-NNN INTRODUCED, SEE DOC/MESSAGE.DOC.

2.0   11-SEP-1989  A.M.S.  TREND CALCULATION AND ALERT REPORT ADDED.
                           MARGIN SLOPE TAKEN FROM FIRST AND LAST
                           REPORT.

2.2   12-OCT-1990  D.O'N.  WORKSHOP INDUCTION SCHEDULING ADDED TO THE
                           AGREEMENT WITH FLEET PLANNING OF THAT DATE.

2.4   17-JUN-1991  A.M.S.  FLIGHT REPORTS CHAINED TO THE OWNING ENGINE
                           INSTEAD OF BEING RESEARCHED PER REPORT.  A
                           FLEET SWEEP NOW TAKES UNDER A MINUTE.

3.0   04-MAY-1992  A.M.S.  LEAST SQUARES FIT REPLACES THE TWO POINT
                           SLOPE.  A MINIMUM OF THREE REPORTS IS NOW
                           DEMANDED BEFORE A RATE IS PUBLISHED.  THIS
                           REMOVED THE BULK OF THE SPURIOUS WATCH
                           ALERTS COMPLAINED OF BY THE CONTROLLERS.

3.1   18-JUL-1993  A.M.S.  ALERT REASON COLUMN ADDED TO THE SUMMARY
                           AND THE ALERT REPORT.  LEGEND PRINTED AT
                           THE FOOT OF THE ALERT REPORT.

3.2   03-DEC-1993  A.M.S.  DATA SET DIRECTORY TAKEN FROM EHMDATA SO
                           THAT THE TEST FLEET CAN BE RUN WITHOUT
                           COPYING THE LIVE MASTERS.

3.4   30-NOV-1994  D.O'N.  ENGINES THAT CANNOT BE PLACED ARE CARRIED
                           ON THE PLAN WITH THE SLOT FIELDS BLANK.
                           RAISED AFTER THE DERBY BAY SHORTAGE.

4.0   21-JAN-1995  D.O'N.  LIFE LIMITED PART CHECK ADDED, CYCLES SINCE
                           NEW AGAINST LLPLIM.  TABLE LIMITS RAISED TO
                           TWO HUNDRED ENGINES AND FOUR THOUSAND
                           REPORTS.

4.1   14-JUL-1995  R.T.H.  OIL PRESSURE EXCEEDANCE COUNT ADDED TO THE
                           ALERT RULES.  TWO LOW READINGS IN THE
                           WINDOW RAISE A WATCH.

4.2C  09-FEB-1996  D.O'N.  RUN DATE TAKEN FROM THE SYSTEM CLOCK WHERE
                           NO -D SWITCH IS GIVEN.  SLOT UTILISATION
                           BLOCK ADDED TO THE FOOT OF THE PLAN.
